WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.794 --> 00:00:04.713
-Hm?
-Look what I have.

00:00:04.796 --> 00:00:06.048
(sniffing)

00:00:06.131 --> 00:00:08.091
-We're going to be best friends.

00:00:09.468 --> 00:00:11.428
Don't be nervous.
You're gonna like it here,

00:00:11.512 --> 00:00:12.346
Ahh!

00:00:13.639 --> 00:00:14.640
Good grief!

00:00:14.723 --> 00:00:16.934
♪ I wanna live like
it's Mardi Gras ♪

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:18.977
♪ And... go dumb with
my whole squad ♪

00:00:19.061 --> 00:00:21.230
♪ And... don't need no R&amp;R ♪

00:00:21.313 --> 00:00:23.065
♪ To regular life,
I say au revoir ♪

00:00:23.649 --> 00:00:25.359
-Marcie, remind me to never pick

00:00:25.442 --> 00:00:27.486
that kid with the big nose
for gym class.

00:00:27.569 --> 00:00:28.362
♪ Good vibes only ♪

00:00:29.321 --> 00:00:30.113
(cheering)

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:36.870
(cheering, laughing)

00:00:44.795 --> 00:00:46.922
♪ Do somethin' crazy ♪

00:00:47.005 --> 00:00:48.841
♪ Do somethin' wild ♪

00:00:48.924 --> 00:00:50.843
♪ Be someone different ♪

00:00:50.926 --> 00:00:52.553
♪ Switch up that style ♪

00:00:53.136 --> 00:00:55.347
-Thanks for the inspiration, Snoopy.

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:57.266
♪ Do somethin' crazy ♪

00:00:58.934 --> 00:00:59.601
(shuddering)

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:02.521
-(howling)

00:01:03.564 --> 00:01:04.982
♪ Do somethin' crazy ♪

00:01:05.065 --> 00:01:07.860
-Whoa!
Can you believe this dog?

00:01:09.027 --> 00:01:10.988
♪ Do somethin' crazy ♪

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:12.406
♪ Do somethin' wild ♪

00:01:12.489 --> 00:01:13.532
♪ Do somethin' crazy ♪

